# basePath Chapter1

:: FirstContractOpen
@trigger    OnContractSelectOpen
@cutscene
@once

{@PAL}      Welcome to employee Orientation! 
{@Player}   Wait... don't I own the ship-
{@PAL}      Irrelevant! To get you strated, we have Frontier Robotics contract for you. 
{@PAL}      You'll have more in the future, but for now, we will start off with just one. 
$call   HighlightElement(overarching:costs-section, false, 25, true)
{@PAL}      It looks like it will take this many days to complete.
$call   ReleaseAllHighlights()
$call   HighlightElement(overarching:profit-section, false, 25, true)
{@PAL}      ...and you'll make this much money if you can deliver.
$call   ReleaseAllHighlights()
{@PAL}      Once signed, you're ready to get started!
{@PAL}      Feel free to go to Research or Design! 
{@Player}   Guess it's time to get started... 
$call   HighlightElement(overarching:select-contract-btn)
$call   UnlockWikiPage("Basic Conductor")
$call   UnlockWikiPage("Basic Insulator")
$call   LockWikiPage("Conductor") // only Basic Conductor is available in first chapter 
$call   LockWikiPage("Insulator") // only Basic Insulator is available in first chapter 

:: FirstContractAccept
@trigger    OnContractAccept
@cutscene
@once
$call   ReleaseAllHighlights()

:: BeforeSupplyChain
@trigger    OnOverarchingLoaded
@when       IsSolutionFoundFor(Design), IsSolutionFoundFor(Research)
@cutscene
@once
{@Player}    P.A.L., why can’t I build the chip yet?
{@PAL}       We are short on conductor materials.
{@PAL}       Your station is too slow for supply runs, so you can hire faster ships.
{@PAL}       The ship fee and materials cost come out of the contract payment.
{@Player}    Wait, I don’t keep all the money? Better keep costs low.


//region Supply Chain Haulers

{@Quinn}    Is... is this thing on?
{@Player}   Uh... P.A.L? Who's that?
{@PAL}      That's your hauler, Quinn! 
{@Player}   Wait, another human?
{@Quinn}    Wow! You sure got some good eyes on you. Very observant.
{@Player}   Uh huh... 
{@PAL}      I believe Quinn is participating the human verbal condition called: 
{@PAL}      Sarcasm. 
{@PAL}      Quinn will follow the routes you draw for material pick-up. 
{@Quinn}    "Follow", more like "guide." I never follow the beaten-path. 
{@Player}   Isn't that... dangerous? 
{@Quinn}    Wait? Space is dangerous? Why didn't you tell me?!
{@Quinn}    Stop leaking cyro fluid Cap', promise I'll be timely and efficient, Hauler's Honor. 
{@Player}   Whatever you say...

//#region - After Supply Chain 

//region Supply Chain - Taryn Intro 

{@Player}   Guess I should call one of the supplier contacts... Cu-6533etc. 
//phone dial character??
{@Taryn}    Oh Universe above. I swear, for the last time, P.A.L. I don't want to do work with you-
{@Player}   Uh... 
{@Taryn}    I'm already at my wits end with Frontier, we all are. 
{@Taryn}    We won't work for you unless you have a human on board, 
{@Taryn}    AND ANOTHER THING-... Oh my stars you're a human. 
{@Player}   Uh. Last time I checked, yeah. 
{@Taryn}    Shoot, uh, sorry! I...
{@Taryn}    I'm Kalvis Sector wait uh no, in the-supplier... uh-
{@Player}   What?
{@Taryn}    Ack-... Sorry. This isn't the first time your ship has contacted me. 
{@Taryn}    Let's just say, P.A.L. left a bad taste in my mouth. 
{@Player}   I see.
{@Taryn}    How about we start over and forget about the embarassing yelling and the word vomit that just happened? 
{@Taryn}    Name's Taryn. I'm the supplier contact for the Kalvis sector. 
{@Player}   Nice to meet you Taryn. I'm Locke. 
{@Taryn}    ...Locke... why does that sound familiar? 
{@Taryn}    Anyways, pleasure to meet you Locke!
{@Taryn}    If you want any materials in our sector, I'm the one to call! 
{@Player}   I'll keep that in mind, thanks! 
//hang up dial.

//end region

//#region Supplier - Ovill

//dial
{@Player}   Oh, a call. 
//pick up tone
{@Ovill}    Boy oh boy do I have a deal for you! 
{@Player}   What?
{@Ovill}    We at Frontier Robotics value our loyal customers. 
{@Ovill}    So much so that we have a super duper exclusive deal just for members like you! 
{@Ovill}    Source with us today, and we'll throw in a complimentary Frontier Robotics swag bag! 
{@Ovill}    This includes a hat, several Robo-Bros trading cards, and an all exclusive poster signed by the CEO himself. Mr. Grayson! 
{@Ovill}    All you need to do is source with us within the next 24 hours, or the deal is gone, Locke, GONE! 
{@Player}   How do you know my name? 
{@Ovill}    Unimportant! So, what do you say, you ready to make a deal?  
{@Player}   Uh... that's neat and all, but I think I only want to source the materials...
{@Ovill}    ...what. 
{@Player}   I just want to source materials. 
{@Ovill}    Did I do the pitch wrong? 
{@Player}   Uh... no- 
{@Ovill}    Oh my stars I came on too strong. 
{@Ovill}    Or was it not strong enough? Maybe if I raise my voice and bring more "pazaaz". Let me start over.
{@Player}   That's not necessary-
{@Ovill}    LOCKE, DO I HAVE A DEAL FOR YOU, IF YOU SOURCE WITH US TODAY- 
{@Player}   I'M NOT INTERESTED!
{@Player}   Not because you did a bad pitch. I just... want to pay off this debt. 
{@Ovill}    So... it wasn't my fault? 
{@Player}   Yes. I guess. 
{@Ovill}    Fantastic!  I can put that in my daily report. Perfect marks.  
{@Ovill}    Though it's odd that you don't want free stuff... I'll write it off as a customer fluke. 
{@Ovill}    Anyways. I'm Representative 32-A345. But you can just call me Ovill. 
{@Ovill}    If you need anything from the Forsch sector, you let me know! I am always open for business! 
{@Player}   Thanks, Ovill. 

// end region



//#region - After Supply Chain 

::AfterSupplyChain 
@trigger    OnOverarchingLoaded
@when       IsSolutionFoundFor(Design), IsSolutionFoundFor(Research), IsSolutionFoundFor(Supply)
@cutscene
@once

{@PAL}      Great, with the materials arriving, now we can get to work!
{@Player}   Have we not been working this entire time?
{@PAL}      We have, but this is where the fun begins!

//#region - Fabrication 
::AfterFabrication 
@trigger    OnOverarchingLoaded
@when       IsSolutionFoundFor(Design), IsSolutionFoundFor(Research), IsSolutionFoundFor(Supply), IsSolutionFoundFor(Fabrication)
@cutscene
@once

{@PAL}      You did it, Captain! Congratulations! 
{@Player}   Okay... I think I am getting the hang of it. 
{@PAL}      Positive.Affirmation.exe! 
{@Player}   What-
{@PAL}      Now it's time to submit the contract, and then you can do it all over again!

//endregion 
            




